{"id":"vod_sn_36551","vodId":"36551","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"食戟之灵第一季","name_cn":"食戟之灵第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/cda19218e844fddd2e399926944ad787.jpg"},"summary":"幸平创真（松冈祯丞 配音）出生于料理世家，其父经营着一间家庭餐馆，小小年纪的幸平即将父亲当做了榜样，发誓成为父亲那样的料理家。某一日，父亲找到了幸平，希望他能够进入顶级的料理学校“远月学园”深造磨练，背负着父亲的期许，幸平踏上了旅程。　　在学校里，幸平结识了名为薙切绘里奈（种田梨沙 配音）的少女，这位传说中拥有“神之舌”的傲娇少女，竟然将幸平所作的料理判定为“不合格”。外表热情开朗内心极有城府的一色慧（樱井孝宏 配音）、拥有孱弱身体和强大头脑的丸井善二（小林裕介 配音）、活泼开朗的吉野悠姬（内田真礼 配音），与这些“同行”交流着，竞争着，幸平还有很长的路要走。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4FMH1jZHiz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MpWZse8bx31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gviaMLr7AC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nB6GRwwnDX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HziBw13vV61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3n6cv4ckZR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Dcd3NyCXG41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q9QgVHQCXU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HWB2h7XjeV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/14vQ3H6hhF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cgsMkjxYY31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MKQvfGWrLY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E1XuUjGaa11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/53S2FE9iSE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集